   TTO on your behalf.

2. Certain components are derived from or integrate with TAPIR
   (https://github.com/google-deepmind/tapnet) and remain subject to the
   Apache License, Version 2.0, as reproduced further below.

3. Certain utility and model files are adapted from PIPs
   (https://github.com/aharley/pips, MIT License) and, in part, from RAFT
   (https://github.com/princeton-vl/RAFT, BSD 3-Clause License), and remain
   subject to those licenses as reproduced further below. This includes
   `model/blocks.py`, `utils/basic.py`, `utils/samp.py`,
   `utils/saverloader.py`, and `utils/trainer.py`.

4. This repository builds on or references other third-party models (for
   example, the base pretrained TAPIR model). Those models' own code and
   weights are NOT covered by the CC BY-NC 4.0 license above and remain
   subject to their original authors' license terms. Please check the
